{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-with-empty-case-convention"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>，DNF 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tc}(D)\\coloneqq|D|,\\qquad\\operatorname{lc}(D)\\coloneqq\\sum_{T\\in D}|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|,\\qquad\\operatorname{dc}(D)\\coloneqq\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|\\mid T\\in D\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tc}(D)\\coloneqq|D|,\\qquad\\operatorname{lc}(D)\\coloneqq\\sum_{T\\in D}|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|,\\qquad\\operatorname{dc}(D)\\coloneqq\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|\\mid T\\in D\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分别为项数、总文字数、最大项长。原书在不同章节复用长度符号，本目录用 tc/lc/dc 分开。dc(空 DNF)=0 是此处明确的边界约定，不是声称原书为零函数指定了这一函数次数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea